<title>HUNGARY: Hungary July PPI up 0.5 pct m/m, 20.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Hungary July PPI up 0.5 pct m/m, 20.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's industrial producer prices rose 0.5 percent in July from June and 20.4 percent year-on-year, the Central Statistical Office (KSH) said on Thursday.  </p>
<p>    PRODUCER PRICES	  July 1996    June 1996   July 1995</p>
<p>    month/month change (pct)  + 0.5	  + 0.7     + 1.3</p>
<p>    year-on-year change (pct) +20.4	  +21.5     +31.2</p>
<p>Domestic sales prices rose 0.3 percent in July over the previous month while export prices increased 0.9 percent.</p>
<p>On a year-on-year basis, domestic sales prices grew 22.0 percent while export prices were up 16.1 percent.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom (36 1) 327-4040</p>
